After forwarding the request, i receveid the following response:

HTTP/2 302 Found
Location: /my-account
Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
Content-Length: 117

{
  "username": "wiener",
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "apikey": "APIKEY",
  "roleid": 2
}

Now, the user wiener is a admin, so the next step is to reload the my-account page and now there is a admin panel link on the user interface, to solve the lab, just access it and delete the user Carlos.
